  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Planning and building local capacity in the watershed area of Morne auguste (3rd and 4th sections) P</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rural women and farmers in the Artibonite department depend on the health of the local ecosystem for food security and quality of life. Platfm Inite ganizasyon Dezam (PLAIOD) provides technical assistance and facilitates conservation and reforestation activities to improve the health of Mome August watershed. At the IAF we support community-led solutions to expand economic opportunity in Haiti. PLAIOD&apos;s activities promote smallholder agriculture to enhance food security and ensure meaningful opportunities for communities to thrive. Amendment Blurb FY24: This amendment provides PLAIOD with an additional 30 months and $316,320 to increase participants? access to credit, reinforce its organizational capacity, increase livestock production, and continue to protect the local environment. As part of the amendment, PLAIOD is mobilizing an additional $327,056 in counterpart resources to the grant agreement.</narrative>
  </description>
